📊 Program 5 — File Statistics

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to analyze the contents of a text file and calculate basic statistics such as the number of lines, words, and characters.

It shows how file input can be combined with character and stream processing.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📖 Reading file contents
- 📏 Counting lines
- 🔤 Counting words
- 🔢 Counting characters
- 📊 Processing text-file data
- 📂 File-position handling

📁 File Used

"message.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Features

"ifstream", character processing, and file positioning
